    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ENG2_U04_L05_GP_Q01</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.ENG2.W.03</p><p>Finding: A district report found that the pre-order pilot reduced unwanted trays. Which sentence best integrates the source?</p>]]></text></questiontext>
